LOCAL DATA\par
Completed virtual imports, favourites and supported Music preferences are saved in this browser and origin. The desktop preview keeps its own records. Music Settings remembers its pretend switches for this visit; Import Settings separately saves the choices used by the virtual CD flow. There is no cloud library sync or Apple account connection.\par
